# Unslop — TA desk + student asks

Scope: `TaWorkspace.jsx` (4-pane Ask Detail desk), `StudentAsksPage.jsx`, TA frame bits in `AppShell.jsx`, shared tokens in `styles.css` (`.tar-*` / theme).

## TA Ask Detail desk (product layout)
- 100vh, zero page scroll: Zone 1 AppShell nav 220px · Zone 2 mini-queue 260px collapsible · Zone 3 center thread+composer · Zone 4 Help Coach 320px collapsible.
- Tokens: forest `#143326` / `#1B4332`, canvas `#F8F7F4`, line `#E2E0D8`; monospace for IDs/timestamps/code (IBM Plex Mono).
- Composer starts empty — never dump Help Coach / teaching draft into the reply textarea by default. Insert into Reply is explicit.
- Progressive status: Claim Ask → Mark Resolved & Next + subtle Release.
- Dense Linear/Intercom chrome — no AI-slop gradients, pill clusters, or redundant action rows.

## Tokens (reuse existing theme where possible)
- Colors: `--theme-ink`, `--theme-forest`, `--tar-*` desk vars, `aui-*` utilities already in `@theme`.
- Type: `--font-sans` (Source Sans 3), `--font-display` (Source Serif 4) only — no Inter/Roboto/Arial swap-ins.
- Spacing: tight `gap` rhythm; avoid one-off magic margins.

## Copy (plain campus voice)
- Prefer product names already in glossary: Ask Triage, Help Coach, Quiet ask.
- Cut AI tells: "AI-powered", "smart draft", emoji flourishes in empty states, hype verbs ("magic", "instant genius").
- Buttons: verb + object ("Claim Ask", "Send Reply", "Insert into Reply") — short.

## Student asks
- Keep stage timeline readable; reduce dashed-box / muted microcopy noise.
- Empty state: one sentence + one CTA.

## Forbidden
- New cards for non-interactive content; purple glow trends; dumping coaching into the student reply by default.
- Changing fetch/auth/queue filter logic or inventing new Help Coach / claim / reply backend features unless required to wire existing endpoints.
